<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Career Decision Intelligence System</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#173226;
color:#F7F2E7;
line-height:1.6;
}

/* HERO */

.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:80px 20px;
background:linear-gradient(180deg,#214534,#173226);
}

.hero h1{
font-size:3rem;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
max-width:900px;
margin:auto;
font-size:1.1rem;
}

/* CONTAINER */

.container{
max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
padding:40px 20px;
}

/* DASHBOARD */

.dashboard{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;
gap:30px;
margin-top:30px;
}

@media(max-width:900px){
.dashboard{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}
}

/* CARD */

.card{
background:#214534;
padding:25px;
border-radius:20px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.card h2{
color:#D5B07C;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

/* FORM */

label{
display:block;
margin-bottom:8px;
font-weight:bold;
}

select,
input{
width:100%;
padding:12px;
margin-bottom:20px;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
background:#F7F2E7;
}

button{
width:100%;
padding:15px;
background:#D5B07C;
color:#173226;
font-weight:bold;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
cursor:pointer;
}

/* RESULTS */

.score{
font-size:4rem;
color:#D5B07C;
text-align:center;
font-weight:bold;
}

.result-box{
background:#2A5943;
padding:15px;
margin-top:15px;
border-radius:12px;
}

/* GRID */

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:20px;
margin-top:40px;
}

.insight-card{
background:#214534;
padding:20px;
border-radius:18px;
}

.insight-card h3{
color:#D5B07C;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

/* MATRIX */

.matrix{
margin-top:50px;
overflow-x:auto;
}

table{
width:100%;
border-collapse:collapse;
}

th{
background:#D5B07C;
color:#173226;
padding:15px;
}

td{
padding:15px;
background:#214534;
border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

/* FOOTER */

footer{
margin-top:60px;
padding:40px;
text-align:center;
opacity:.8;
}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">

<h1>🎯 Career Decision Intelligence System</h1>

<p>
Stop choosing careers based only on salary.
Compare opportunities based on earning potential, lifestyle,
future demand, automation resistance, growth opportunities,
and personal interest.
</p>

</section>

<div class="container">

<div class="dashboard">

<!-- LEFT -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Career Evaluation Engine</h2>

<label>Career Interest</label>
<select>
<option>Web Development</option>
<option>Digital Marketing</option>
<option>Cybersecurity</option>
<option>Electrician</option>
<option>HVAC Technician</option>
<option>Nursing</option>
<option>Project Management</option>
<option>Entrepreneurship</option>
</select>

<label>Personal Interest Level (1-10)</label>
<input type="number" placeholder="8">

<label>Expected Salary</label>
<input type="number" placeholder="$60,000">

<label>Automation Risk (1-10)</label>
<input type="number" placeholder="3">

<label>Work-Life Balance (1-10)</label>
<input type="number" placeholder="7">

<label>Education Cost</label>
<input type="number" placeholder="$5,000">

<label>Job Growth Outlook (1-10)</label>
<input type="number" placeholder="9">

<button>Calculate Career Score</button>

</div>

<!-- RIGHT -->

<div class="card">

<h2>Career Intelligence Score</h2>

<div class="score">87</div>

<div class="result-box">
<strong>Recommendation:</strong><br>
Strong long-term opportunity with favorable growth and manageable risk.
</div>

<div class="result-box">
<strong>Strength:</strong><br>
High demand and strong earning potential.
</div>

<div class="result-box">
<strong>Risk:</strong><br>
Requires continuous learning to remain competitive.
</div>

</div>

</div>

<!-- INSIGHTS -->

<h2 style="margin-top:60px;color:#D5B07C;">
Career Decision Framework
</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div class="insight-card">
<h3>💰 Income Potential</h3>
<p>
What can this career realistically earn after 5–10 years?
</p>
</div>

<div class="insight-card">
<h3>🧠 Skill Portability</h3>
<p>
Can the skills transfer across industries?
</p>
</div>

<div class="insight-card">
<h3>📈 Growth Outlook</h3>
<p>
Will demand increase or decrease over time?
</p>
</div>

<div class="insight-card">
<h3>🤖 Automation Resistance</h3>
<p>
How difficult would it be for AI or automation to replace?
</p>
</div>

<div class="insight-card">
<h3>🌍 Geographic Flexibility</h3>
<p>
Can the career be performed remotely or globally?
</p>
</div>

<div class="insight-card">
<h3>⚖ Lifestyle Impact</h3>
<p>
Consider stress, schedules, and family life.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<!-- MATRIX -->

<div class="matrix">

<h2 style="margin-bottom:20px;color:#D5B07C;">
Career Comparison Matrix
</h2>

<table>

<tr>
<th>Career</th>
<th>Income</th>
<th>Growth</th>
<th>Automation Risk</th>
<th>Education Cost</th>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Cybersecurity</td>
<td>High</td>
<td>High</td>
<td>Low</td>
<td>Medium</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Electrician</td>
<td>High</td>
<td>High</td>
<td>Very Low</td>
<td>Low</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Digital Marketing</td>
<td>Medium</td>
<td>Medium</td>
<td>Medium</td>
<td>Low</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>Nursing</td>
<td>High</td>
<td>High</td>
<td>Very Low</td>
<td>High</td>
</tr>

</table>

</div>

<!-- ADVANCED SECTION -->

<div class="card" style="margin-top:50px;">

<h2>🔍 Questions Most People Never Ask</h2>

<ul style="padding-left:20px;">
<li>Will this career still exist in 15 years?</li>
<li>Can I build a side business using these skills?</li>
<li>Does this path improve my future options?</li>
<li>Can this career become remote?</li>
<li>Will this work damage my physical health?</li>
<li>How difficult is advancement?</li>
<li>Could these skills help me start a company?</li>
<li>Does this career fit the life I want?</li>
</ul>

</div>

</div>

<footer>

🌿 Pathkeeper Career Intelligence System • Make decisions using evidence, not guesswork.

</footer>

</body>
</html>
